## Key Learning

Amazon SES provides a secure and reliable SMTP relay service for Linux mail servers. By configuring Sendmail to relay outbound emails through 
the SES SMTP endpoint using authenticated and encrypted SMTP connections, monitoring scripts can send email alerts reliably without maintaining 
an on-premises mail server. This approach offers high availability, improved deliverability, and centralized email management for cloud-hosted 
Linux environments.
